{"id": 2326, "modified": "2026-10-18T10:34:40", "content": {"raw": "<!-- wp:columns {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\",\"className\":\"medlux-intro\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns are-vertically-aligned-center medlux-intro\"><!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"medlux-lead\"} -->\n<p class=\"medlux-lead\">A tummy tuck removes excess skin and fat from the abdomen and tightens the underlying muscles \u2013 often after major weight loss or pregnancy. Whether a full or a mini abdominoplasty suits you is decided with your surgeon. MedLuxLife arranges your online consultation with the surgeon in Istanbul and organises your stay.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":1414,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"className\":\"medlux-intro-img\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-intro-img\"><img src=\"https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/chirurgische-markierungen-am-bauch-opt-1.jpg\" alt=\"Surgeon marking the abdomen before a tummy tuck\" class=\"wp-image-1414\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-section medlux-facts-sec\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-section medlux-facts-sec\"><!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Quick facts</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-facts\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-facts\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-fact\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-fact\"><!-- wp:image {\"className\":\"medlux-card-icon\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image medlux-card-icon\"><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,\" alt=\"\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"medlux-fact-label\"} -->\n<p class=\"medlux-fact-label\">Anaesthesia</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"medlux-fact-value\"} -->\n<p class=\"medlux-fact-value\">General anaesthesia</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-fact\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-fact\"><!-- wp:image {\"className\":\"medlux-card-icon\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image medlux-card-icon\"><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,\" alt=\"\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"medlux-fact-label\"} -->\n<p class=\"medlux-fact-label\">Operation time</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"medlux-fact-value\"} -->\n<p class=\"medlux-fact-value\">About 2\u20134 hours</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-fact\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-fact\"><!-- wp:image {\"className\":\"medlux-card-icon\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image medlux-card-icon\"><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,\" alt=\"\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"medlux-fact-label\"} -->\n<p class=\"medlux-fact-label\">Hospital stay</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"medlux-fact-value\"} -->\n<p class=\"medlux-fact-value\">Usually 1\u20132 nights</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-fact\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-fact\"><!-- wp:image {\"className\":\"medlux-card-icon\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image medlux-card-icon\"><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,\" alt=\"\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"medlux-fact-label\"} -->\n<p class=\"medlux-fact-label\">Daily activities</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"medlux-fact-value\"} -->\n<p class=\"medlux-fact-value\">After about 10\u201314 days</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-fact\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-fact\"><!-- wp:image {\"className\":\"medlux-card-icon\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image medlux-card-icon\"><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,\" alt=\"\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"medlux-fact-label\"} -->\n<p class=\"medlux-fact-label\">Stay in T\u00fcrkiye</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"medlux-fact-value\"} -->\n<p class=\"medlux-fact-value\">Planned individually with the clinic</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"medlux-facts-note\"} -->\n<p class=\"medlux-facts-note\">General information; your surgeon plans the details for you personally.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-section medlux-suitable\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-section medlux-suitable\"><!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Who it may be suitable for</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"className\":\"medlux-checklist\"} -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list medlux-checklist\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>You have loose abdominal skin or weakened abdominal muscles after weight loss or pregnancy.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Your weight has been stable for some time.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Ideally, your family planning is complete.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>You are in good general health.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"medlux-suitable-note\"} -->\n<p class=\"medlux-suitable-note\">Whether the procedure is suitable for you is decided by the surgeon after a personal assessment.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-section\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-section\"><!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Types of tummy tuck</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-treatment-grid medlux-centered-cards medlux-cols-2\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"grid\",\"minimumColumnWidth\":\"14rem\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-treatment-grid medlux-centered-cards medlux-cols-2\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card\"><!-- wp:image {\"className\":\"medlux-card-icon\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image medlux-card-icon\"><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,\" alt=\"\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Full abdominoplasty</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>An incision from hip to hip, often with repositioning of the navel.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card\"><!-- wp:image {\"className\":\"medlux-card-icon\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image medlux-card-icon\"><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,\" alt=\"\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Mini abdominoplasty</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>A shorter incision for minor excess skin below the navel.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-section\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-section\"><!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">How the operation is performed</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-treatment-grid medlux-centered-cards medlux-stages\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"grid\",\"minimumColumnWidth\":\"14rem\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-treatment-grid medlux-centered-cards medlux-stages\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card\"><!-- wp:image {\"className\":\"medlux-card-icon\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image medlux-card-icon\"><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,\" alt=\"\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Consultation before surgery</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The surgeon examines your abdomen, discusses your wishes and plans how excess skin, fat and weakened muscles are treated.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card\"><!-- wp:image {\"className\":\"medlux-card-icon\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image medlux-card-icon\"><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,\" alt=\"\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Anaesthesia and preparation</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>You receive general anaesthesia. The area is prepared and marked to guide the skin and muscle adjustments.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card\"><!-- wp:image {\"className\":\"medlux-card-icon\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image medlux-card-icon\"><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,\" alt=\"\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Removing excess skin and fat</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Through a horizontal incision in the lower abdomen, the surgeon removes excess skin and fat and tightens the abdominal muscles. Liposuction is sometimes combined.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card\"><!-- wp:image {\"className\":\"medlux-card-icon\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image medlux-card-icon\"><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,\" alt=\"\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Closure and recovery</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The incision is closed with fine sutures and a compression garment is put on. You usually stay in hospital for 1\u20132 nights.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-section\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-section\"><!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">How it works with MedLuxLife</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-steps medlux-steps\\u002d\\u002dlist\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-steps medlux-steps--list\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><span class=\"medlux-step-no\">1</span>Contact and online consultation</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Contact us and tell us what you are interested in. We refer you to the right surgeon for an online consultation. Photos or medical documents go directly to the doctor, only on request.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><span class=\"medlux-step-no\">2</span>Your personal plan</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The surgeon recommends the right approach for you. We plan your dates, flights, hotel and transfers around it.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><span class=\"medlux-step-no\">3</span>Arrival and surgery</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>After a pre-operative examination, the operation takes place as planned. You usually stay in hospital for 1\u20132 nights.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><span class=\"medlux-step-no\">4</span>Recovery in Istanbul</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>You rest in your hotel and attend the check-ups at the clinic. The surgeon decides when you are ready to fly home.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><span class=\"medlux-step-no\">5</span>Back home</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Stay in touch with us on WhatsApp \u2013 we help with follow-up questions.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-section\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-section\"><!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Recovery step by step</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-treatment-grid medlux-centered-cards medlux-timeline\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"grid\",\"minimumColumnWidth\":\"14rem\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-treatment-grid medlux-centered-cards medlux-timeline\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"medlux-time-label\"} -->\n<p class=\"medlux-time-label\">First days</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Gentle walking soon after surgery and 1\u20132 nights in hospital. A compression garment supports healing.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"medlux-time-label\"} -->\n<p class=\"medlux-time-label\">Weeks 2\u20136</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Most people return to work and light routines after 10\u201314 days. The compression garment is worn for 4\u20136 weeks.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"medlux-time-label\"} -->\n<p class=\"medlux-time-label\">After 6 weeks</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Heavy lifting and strenuous sport are possible again, as advised by your surgeon.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-section\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-section\"><!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Frequently asked questions</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:accordion {\"className\":\"medlux-faq\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"blockGap\":\"var:preset|spacing|20\"}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div role=\"group\" class=\"wp-block-accordion medlux-faq\"><!-- wp:accordion-item {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"blockGap\":\"0\"}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-accordion-item\"><!-- wp:accordion-heading -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle\"><span class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle-title\">How long does the operation take?</span><span class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+</span></button></h3>\n<!-- /wp:accordion-heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:accordion-panel -->\n<div role=\"region\" class=\"wp-block-accordion-panel\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>About 2\u20134 hours under general anaesthesia, depending on whether a full or mini tummy tuck is done, followed by 1\u20132 nights in hospital.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:accordion-panel --></div>\n<!-- /wp:accordion-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:accordion-item {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"blockGap\":\"0\"}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-accordion-item\"><!-- wp:accordion-heading -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle\"><span class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle-title\">Do I need to wear a compression garment?</span><span class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+</span></button></h3>\n<!-- /wp:accordion-heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:accordion-panel -->\n<div role=\"region\" class=\"wp-block-accordion-panel\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Yes, usually for 4\u20136 weeks. It reduces swelling and supports the new contour.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:accordion-panel --></div>\n<!-- /wp:accordion-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:accordion-item {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"blockGap\":\"0\"}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-accordion-item\"><!-- wp:accordion-heading -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle\"><span class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle-title\">When can I return to work?</span><span class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+</span></button></h3>\n<!-- /wp:accordion-heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:accordion-panel -->\n<div role=\"region\" class=\"wp-block-accordion-panel\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Most people return to work and light routines after 10\u201314 days; heavy lifting should wait about 6 weeks.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:accordion-panel --></div>\n<!-- /wp:accordion-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:accordion-item {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"blockGap\":\"0\"}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-accordion-item\"><!-- wp:accordion-heading -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle\"><span class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle-title\">Can I get pregnant after a tummy tuck?</span><span class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+</span></button></h3>\n<!-- /wp:accordion-heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:accordion-panel -->\n<div role=\"region\" class=\"wp-block-accordion-panel\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Yes, but a later pregnancy can stretch the skin and muscles again. It is usually recommended to wait until your family planning is complete.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:accordion-panel --></div>\n<!-- /wp:accordion-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:accordion-item {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"blockGap\":\"0\"}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-accordion-item\"><!-- wp:accordion-heading -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle\"><span class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle-title\">How long should I stay in T\u00fcrkiye?</span><span class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+</span></button></h3>\n<!-- /wp:accordion-heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:accordion-panel -->\n<div role=\"region\" class=\"wp-block-accordion-panel\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>This is planned individually with the clinic. We organise your flights and hotel accordingly.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:accordion-panel --></div>\n<!-- /wp:accordion-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:accordion-item {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"blockGap\":\"0\"}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-accordion-item\"><!-- wp:accordion-heading -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle\"><span class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle-title\">Should I send photos or medical documents to MedLuxLife?</span><span class=\"wp-block-accordion-heading__toggle-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+</span></button></h3>\n<!-- /wp:accordion-heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:accordion-panel -->\n<div role=\"region\" class=\"wp-block-accordion-panel\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>No. If the surgeon needs photos or documents, you share them directly with the doctor in your online consultation.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:accordion-panel --></div>\n<!-- /wp:accordion-item --></div>\n<!-- /wp:accordion --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-cta\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-cta\"><!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Plan your tummy tuck</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Contact us and tell us what you are interested in \u2013 we refer you to the right specialist for an online consultation.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"medlux-btn-primary\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button medlux-btn-primary\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://medluxlife.de/contact/\">Request a Free Consultation</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button -->\n\n<!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"medlux-btn-whatsapp\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button medlux-btn-whatsapp\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://wa.me/380979092326\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">WhatsApp</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"medlux-disclaimer\"} -->\n<p class=\"medlux-disclaimer\">The information on this page is for general guidance only and does not replace a medical consultation. Suitability for any treatment is assessed individually by a qualified doctor.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n"}}